# Lab 05 – Data Preparation

## Overview
This lab focused on preparing data before using it in a machine learning model.

## What I Learned
- How to clean datasets
- How to handle missing values
- How to prepare features for machine learning
- Why preprocessing affects model performance

## Tools Used
- Python
- pandas
- scikit-learn

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand that machine learning models depend heavily on clean and well-prepared data.
